      "message": "This buffer is allocated for every stream and never shrinks: after one 200 KB event it keeps a 256 KiB array for the rest of the stream\u0027s life, and every frame is now copied into it before parsing. Could we keep it null until a partial line actually remains, parse complete lines straight from the frame, and release it once the line is complete?",
